<task id="063" project="ai-advanced-capabilities-analysis-hub-r1">
  <metadata>
    <title>Delete web resources + AnalysisWorkspace/ tree + deploy script + reconcile casing</title>
    <phase>6 Retirement</phase>
    <gate>blocked — 060, 061, 062 (all repoints/retirement done first)</gate>
    <status>completed</status>
    <rigor>FULL</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>Irreversible deletion of a source tree + a deploy script + environment web resources; a dangling reference or a wrongly-deleted shared-lib file breaks build/deploy. deploy/code-page tags.</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>sonnet</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>Deletion set is fully enumerated; the only judgment is not deleting the shared-lib files extracted FROM AnalysisWorkspace — bounded with an explicit keep-list.</model-tier-reason>
    <effort>high</effort>
    <parallel-group>none</parallel-group>
    <parallel-safe>false</parallel-safe>
    <parallel-reason>Ordered retirement tail (§13.5): deletion runs only after every repoint (060,061) and the legacy-session retirement (062) so nothing dangles.</parallel-reason>
    <deps>060,061,062</deps>
    <tags>retirement, deploy, code-page</tags>
    <estimated-effort>2-4 hours</estimated-effort>
