  <constraints>
    <constraint source="project">SCOPE: delete ONLY the AnalysisWorkspace code-page tree + Deploy-AnalysisWorkspace.ps1 + the 3 environment artifacts (sprk_analysisworkspace HTML, sprk_AnalysisWorkspaceLauncher JS, dead sprk_analysisworkspace_8bc0b). Do NOT delete the shared-lib files extracted from it: ThreePaneLayout, useTwoPanelLayout, SprkChatBridge, renderMarkdown, StreamingWriteHarness — verify each is imported by a surviving consumer before concluding it is shared.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">SCOPE: no solution XML references these names — do NOT edit solution XML; deletion is code/scripts + environment web-resource removal only.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">SCOPE: ordered §13.5 tail — this runs LAST among 060/061/062; if any repoint is incomplete, STOP (deletion would create a 404/dangling ref).</constraint>
