    <step order="1">Grep the surviving codebase for imports of the keep-list files (ThreePaneLayout, useTwoPanelLayout, SprkChatBridge, renderMarkdown, StreamingWriteHarness) to confirm each lives in the shared lib with a surviving consumer (NOT only inside the tree being deleted).</step>
    <step order="2">Delete src/client/code-pages/AnalysisWorkspace/ in full (launcher/, src/, build-webresource.ps1) and scripts/Deploy-AnalysisWorkspace.ps1.</step>
    <step order="3">Remove the Dataverse environment web resources: sprk_analysisworkspace (HTML), sprk_AnalysisWorkspaceLauncher (JS), and the dead custom page sprk_analysisworkspace_8bc0b — via the code-page-deploy/PAC path.</step>
    <step order="4">Reconcile the 4-name casing: Grep C#/JS/TS/solution for sprk_analysisworkspace, sprk_AnalysisWorkspace, sprk_AnalysisWorkspaceLauncher, sprk_analysisworkspace_8bc0b; confirm zero dangling code references; clean trivial kept doc-comment mentions where cheap.</step>
